{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a2-practice-16","level":"A2","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"warten auf, sich interessieren für","bn":"Verb + Preposition"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich warte ___ meinen Freund.","options":["für","mit","auf"],"answer":2,"explanation":"warten auf।","id":"a2-practice-16-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Er interessiert sich ___ Fußball.","options":["für","auf","an"],"answer":0,"explanation":"sich interessieren für।","id":"a2-practice-16-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"কোন বাক্যটি সঠিক?","options":["Ich schwimmen möchte heute.","Ich möchte heute schwimmen.","Ich möchte schwimmen heute."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Modal verb দ্বিতীয় স্থানে, মূল verb শেষে।","id":"a2-practice-16-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Wir müssen heute lange arbeiten.“ বাক্যে মূল কাজের verb কোনটি?","options":["müssen","lange","arbeiten"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-16-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ich interessiere mich für Musik.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমি সংগীতের প্রতি আগ্রহী।","আমি সংগীত শিখি।","আমি সংগীত পছন্দ করি না।"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-16-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Wettervorhersage“ মানে কী?","options":["জলবায়ু","আবহাওয়ার পূর্বাভাস","আবহাওয়ার পরিবর্তন"],"answer":1,"id":"a2-practice-16-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Heute sind es 30 Grad.“ মানে কী?","options":["আজ ৩০ মিনিট।","আজ ৩০ তারিখ।","আজ ৩০ ডিগ্রি।"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-16-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Mülltonne“ মানে কী?","options":["আবর্জনার পাত্র","ফেরতযোগ্য বোতল","পুরনো কাগজ"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-16-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„der Nebel“ মানে কী?","options":["বরফ","কুয়াশা","ঝড়"],"answer":1,"id":"a2-practice-16-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Sport treiben“ মানে কী?","options":["খেলা দেখা","খেলা কেনা","খেলাধুলা করা"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-16-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Der Ausflug war anstrengend.“ মানে কী?","options":["ভ্রমণটা ক্লান্তিকর ছিল।","ভ্রমণটা আরামদায়ক ছিল।","ভ্রমণটা মজার ছিল।"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-16-q11"},{"type":"mcq","promp